WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.291
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:05.708
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.791 --> 00:00:07.500
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.625
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:10.250
This is

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.583
The Champions

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:13.958
I kick shins and knees like they’re balls. 

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.125
I also kick balls like they’re balls.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:17.458
I am so pumped to join Chelsea,

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:18.708
because I was in danger

00:00:18.708 --> 00:00:20.083
of actually winning things at Dortmund,

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:21.416
and that would go against everything

00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:23.416
the U.S. men's national team believes in. 

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:25.291
Every time we get a bad result,

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.083
I take a hard look in the mirror...

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:29.125
and I blame the officials, the wind,

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:31.500
the cut of the grass, the smells of the stadium, the

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.500
I’m back, and winning

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.125
I’m back, and winning

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:35.250
is in my jeans.

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:53.833
Nice to finally be out of that shadow.

00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:58.041
Hey Cristiano

00:00:58.041 --> 00:00:59.416
not to be that guy, but

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:01.375
would you sign my Ronaldo jersey? 

00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:02.083
Of course.

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.500
It is very tiny. 

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.500
It's from when I was a baby.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.166
It's from when you were a baby?

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.250
Oh my God, you're like a man now.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.083
And you...are a legend.

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.083
Merci, mon ami.

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:12.958
A legend? 

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:17.583
Like...Raul? Or Pele? Or Figo? 

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:18.958
Legends are old. 

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:21.958
No. Am I...old? 

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.166
Thank you for seeing me

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:26.166
doctor Iceland guy. 

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:27.875
I'm having an emergency. 

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:29.208
Oh no, did you chip a tooth? 

00:01:29.208 --> 00:01:29.916
What? No! 

00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:30.833
My teeth are perfect.

00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:32.416
I here because...

00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:34.208
I think I'm aging.

00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:35.541
I don't think he understands

00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:37.291
what a dentist does. 

00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:40.708
Cristiano, you have the body of a 23-year-old. 

00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:43.458
23? Oh no. 

00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:45.083
Just a year ago all the doctors say

00:01:45.083 --> 00:01:46.708
I have body of 22-year-old. 

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:47.833
Now he tells me 23?!

00:01:47.833 --> 00:01:49.750
This is more serious than I thought.

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:52.500
I thought it best to seek out advice

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.958
from another Juventus legend.

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:56.166
One who has suffered for many years

00:01:56.166 --> 00:01:57.541
with...the aging. 

00:01:57.541 --> 00:01:59.625
Aging is nothing to fear.

00:01:59.625 --> 00:02:02.541
I have been 50 years old since I was 25.

00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:04.416
It's just scary to think that one day

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:07.000
I might not be the best player in the world.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:08.458
Maybe it's time for you 

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:09.833
to take a long look in the mirror.

00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.125
Oh nice, do you have a mirror?

00:02:11.125 --> 00:02:12.583
No, what I mean is,

00:02:12.583 --> 00:02:14.875
do you expect to play this game forever?

00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:16.041
Umm...

00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:17.041
yeah? 

00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:19.083
Nobody can play this game forever. 

00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:20.791
You are mortal. You can die. 

00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:22.708
You are going to get old. 

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:23.500
You are going to die. 

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:26.500
So at this point, I'm like, whoa.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.458
For someone known for his passes,

00:02:28.458 --> 00:02:30.375
Andrea can be quite a straight shooter.

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:32.041
So, so what... 

00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:34.333
am I going to have to...like...retire someday?

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.041
Not yet. You still have 

00:02:36.041 --> 00:02:37.416
a few years with the Old Lady. 

00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:38.666
What do you mean Old Lady? 

00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:40.333
Oh...Georgina is 25.

00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:41.541
I mean Juventus.

00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:42.875
OK, but then what?

00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:45.958
Then...you do what all the former elite players do.

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.250
Are you an aging soccer

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:49.625
er...sorry, football star in Europe? 

00:02:49.625 --> 00:02:51.291
Come join MLS!

00:02:51.291 --> 00:02:52.750
Where you can score three goals a game!

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.375
Make hundreds of millions of dollars!

00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:55.833
And you won't get bothered on the streets 

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:57.375
because no one will recognize you!

00:02:57.375 --> 00:02:59.041
Note: The U.S. dollar may be worth less

00:02:59.041 --> 00:02:59.791
than euros and pounds.

00:02:59.791 --> 00:03:00.833
In MLS you may be forced

00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.000
to play defense and take commercial flights. 

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:02.958
Also everyone has guns. 

00:03:02.958 --> 00:03:04.458
Come on over! It's actually 

00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:05.791
more challenging than you think!

00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:06.250
Believe me.

00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:09.750
Oh God, I need to go. 

00:03:14.083 --> 00:03:17.083
Hello, worse Ronaldo. I'm so scared.

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:19.458
Please tell me retirement will be OK.

00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:20.916
Oh, no, it's great

00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:22.666
you get to eat whatever you want!

